Package: mgx.tools
Type: Package
Title: helper functions for metagenomics and amplicon sequencing processing
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jonathan", "Rondeau-Leclaire",
      email = "jonathan.rondeau.leclaire@gmail.com",
      role = "cre"
    )
  )
Description: This package contains multiple helper functions for processing
    short reads shotgun and amplicon sequencing data when the objective is to
    go from raw data to phyloseq object. It includes rewrites of existing 
    functions to allow them to use multiple cores when available, as well as
    short utility functions that help making informed decisions for data
    filtering and processing.
